# Copy to "backends.txt" (same folder as server.py). One LiveTalking server per line, best first.
# The app uses the first one that answers. If it dies mid-call, the app switches to the next one by itself.
# The file is re-read on every call, so when a free host gives you a new address, edit this file. No restart needed.
http://127.0.0.1:8010
